WEBVTT

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.500
Hi, this is Ahnenerbe-

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.580
We don't sell Mapo Tofu!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:27.460
How rude! Sheesh...

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.430
For the millionth time, we only do curry-

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.340
That's not what you meant?

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:38.810
Hmm? The carnival is starting?

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:40.390
The Carnival Moment?

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.560
That's right. The Carnival Moment.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:51.570
Occurring once every ten years, it is a time when various tales cross paths.

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:56.820
It transcends obligations, adult circumstances, and morals.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.830
The carnival begins!

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:05.830
A new dimension where those who've
never come across each other can meet.

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:09.590
As a choice of life, it could be <i>wild</i>.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:12.460
In another sense, it'd be <i>unlucky</i>.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.550
Now, let us all enjoy...

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:22.100
this fleeting carnival.

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.730
So what's that supposed to mean?

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.440
Well, I don't know.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.120
The Holy Grail War.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:14.290
It is a bloody battle between magicians for the Holy Grail, an omnipotent wish-granting tool.

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.750
Saber.

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:16.630
Lancer.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.670
Archer.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.710
Rider.

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:19.970
Caster.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.180
Assassin.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.760
Berserker.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:27.310
These seven Servants and the Masters that employ them

00:03:27.310 --> 00:03:31.350
must continue to fight until only one team remains.

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:38.190
Even now, a fierce battle for the Holy Grail is about to begin.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:46.280
Um, this comes with short notice, but the
rules of the Holy Grail War have changed!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:54.210
The 5th Great Clash of the Magicians: the Holy Grail War!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:59.260
Good evening, ladies and gentlemen!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:02.800
I'm your host, Ilyasviel von Einzbern!

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:04.340
I am Kotomine Kirei.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.930
The 5th Holy Grail War has finally begun.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:13.390
We bring you this event live from a special stage at the Fuyuki City Public Gymnasium.

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.730
Now, the Holy Grail that appears only once every ten years...

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:19.650
will finally have its owner decided tonight!

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:24.070
Who will win the Holy Grail and have their wishes granted?!

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:25.910
That would be me!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:30.040
Be sure to enjoy your fill of this fleeting liveliness!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.710
We won't let anyone else have the Holy Grail.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.330
Right, Soichiro-sama?

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.840
Master, there is no need to worry.

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.050
Of course! Don't embarrass me.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.720
Shirou!

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:55.390
A holy battle between knights should not be this showy!

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:56.980
W-Why are you complaining to me?

00:04:57.270 --> 00:04:59.480
We're definitely winning this, Archer.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.230
I intended that from the start.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:05.030
Got it? We'll use any dirty measures
necessary to win the Holy Grail...

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.530
Yes! We'll do our best, fair and square!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.740
Tohsaka...

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.120
Oh, that's right, everyone.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.540
The use of Noble Phantasms is forbidden!

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.580
We can't have you destroying the city.

00:05:16.580 --> 00:05:17.830
It's a little late for that!

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.290
To be honest, it'd be a pain to clean up the mess afterwards.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.670
Didn't take you long to speak your mind.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:26.510
I just can't hide the fact that the school's entire student body is growing weaker...

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.840
Are you a middle-aged man whining about his job?!

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:31.350
How are we gonna fight this out, then?!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.020
Let's see... you will fight by...

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:35.730
Wait a sec. What's that?

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:47.320
A single match starts a fire...

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.490
Damn you, Archer...

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:54.120
Just what Hero are you?!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.620
Don't call me a dog!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:56.750
Bastard!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.170
Rin.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.130
I wasted ten years of my life for this...?

00:06:02.130 --> 00:06:03.590
Are you crying, Tohsaka?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:04.510
Shirou!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.130
I couldn't get a single card!

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.010
Don't give up!

00:06:08.090 --> 00:06:10.180
The next match is...

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:16.180
Way too much muscle...

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.980
Oh no! This skirt is too short.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.190
Who's that?!

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:23.900
Before!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.780
After!

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:28.780
I guess this isn't too bad once in a while, though.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.910
Soichiro-sama!

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.330
Eliminated for breaking the rules.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:45.760
Berserker can't possibly compete in anything with rules!

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:46.800
Indeed.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:51.220
Huh?

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:53.100
Why the heck am I Blackbeard?!

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:54.850
There's no other choice.

00:06:54.850 --> 00:06:57.060
Abide by the result of the draw, Lancer!

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.100
Whoa! Stop!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.100
Get him!

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.020
Hey!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.730
Aren't you a sight to behold, weakling?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.520
Gilgamesh!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:06.480
However, this is taking too long.

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:07.990
Way too long!

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:09.900
Gate of...

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:11.450
Babylon.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.700
Wait, wait, wait! The use of Noble Phantasms is forbidden!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:18.700
I <i>am</i> the rules.

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:26.210
Lancer died!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.510
You aren't human!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.090
Rule Breaker!

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.510
Hey! That's my line!

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:34.640
Your things are my things!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.060
He's the oldest bully in human history...

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:41.390
The next match is...

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:43.400
the King's Game!

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.480
I'm already a king.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.770
So am I.

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:51.030
Event ended!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.280
What?!

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:53.280
And so...

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.530
The ferocity of the 5th Holy Grail War reached its maximum.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.540
The battle was bloody and violent.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:02.000
As for what they saw...

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:15.850
I had no idea the Holy Grail War was such a difficult battle...

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:23.480
Is that...

00:08:23.480 --> 00:08:24.980
...the Holy Grail?!

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.690
It's all...

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:28.770
It's all because of that...!

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:30.230
Trace on!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:33.360
Shirou!

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.390
It's been released, at long last!

00:08:58.760 --> 00:08:59.890
What are you?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.980
Receive him.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:26.170
Why?!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.460
Kiritsugu, have I become a hero?

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:38.220
Does this mean the Holy Grail is too
much for today's humans to handle?

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:40.350
Why are you making this sound like it was a good story?!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.100
That's because I don't know what to do!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.520
Whining again?

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.480
That was fun!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:50.020
Are they doing this again next week?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:50.900
No way.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:59.200
Justice isn't something you can speak of lightly.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.280
The True Ancestor's section is next.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.670
Here I go!

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:15.970
Magic Circuit Fullcount!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.550
Marble Phantasm!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:33.270
A new enemy appears in front of Phantasmoon.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.440
She is the demon Akiha!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.780
She's so scary... it feels like I'll lose!

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.950
O moon, let me believe in love once more!

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:42.530
And the ally who appeared then...

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:45.700
Ren, what's that Chikuwa for?!

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.080
Next, on White Moon Princess Phantasmoon:

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.460
The Yam-digging Competition!

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:55.170
I'll Marble Phantasm your heart next time, too!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.180
This is the real thing.

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.730
Next episode preview!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.690
Guys! Girls! Kiss!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:37.150
That's a New Age greeting.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.320
The Tiger Dojo begins now!

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.900
The instructor will be me, the tiger of Fuyuki!

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.860
Roar!

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:43.820
And...

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.820
I'm the assistant, Student No. 1!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:48.870
Look, we're animated this time.

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:49.490
You're right.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:50.450
So...

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:52.660
The Tiger Dojo finally...

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.290
allows movements like this, too!

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:58.590
If you move so much, the budget will...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.920
The budget'll be completely spent anyway,

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:05.180
so I'll take this chance to move as much as I want!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:07.470
Money gotten should be immediately spent!

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:08.140
Next!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.430
Badump! Melty Blood!

00:13:10.430 --> 00:13:11.470
Look forward to it!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.850
Aah, extravagance is the enemy!
